---
Store Slack credentials in config

Usage: qam slack set [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --channel <channel>  Default Slack channel or user
      --config <path>      Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
      --token <token>      Slack API token
  -h, --help               Print help
